<title>USA: F&amp;M BANCORP COMPLETES DEAL FOR LANDMARK.</title>
<headline>F&amp;M BANCORP COMPLETES DEAL FOR LANDMARK.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M Bancorporation said Wednesday it has completed the acquisition of Landmark Bank, a subsidiary of Clear Lake Bancorporation Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed. Landmark, which will be renamed F&amp;M Bank-Landmark, has assets of about $35 million, F&amp;M said.</p>
<p>F&amp;M Bancorporation, a multi-bank holding company, serves customers in Wisconsin and Minnesota.</p>
<p>((--Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
